    {"Left and right: the hands' size. Big fists hit hard!", {"Left and right: the hands' size. Big fists hit hard!", "Tamanho das m\303\243os. Punho grande bate forte!", "Tama\303\261o de las manos. \302\241Pu\303\261os grandes pegan fuerte!"}},
