    {"Every warrior needs a battle cry. Whose shall it be?", {"Every warrior needs a battle cry. Whose shall it be?", "Todo guerreiro precisa de um grito. De quem ser\303\241?", "Todo guerrero necesita un grito. \302\277De qui\303\251n?"}},
    {"A splash of colour! Paint any part of your warrior.", {"A splash of colour! Paint any part of your warrior.", "Um toque de cor! Pinte qualquer parte.", "\302\241Un toque de color! Pinta cualquier parte."}},
    {"Transforms into another warrior you made. Left and right to choose. In battle, use the normal transform input.", {"Transforms into another warrior you made. Left and right to choose. In battle, use the normal transform input.", "Vira outro guerreiro seu. Escolha qual. Na luta, use o comando normal de transforma\303\247\303\243o.", "Se transforma en otro guerrero tuyo. En combate usa el comando normal."}},
