    {"The glow transformed fighters have, like Super Saiyans. Left and right to change it.", {"The glow transformed fighters have, like Super Saiyans. Left and right to change it.", "O brilho dos transformados, como Super Saiyajins.", "El brillo de los transformados, como Super Saiyan."}},
    {"Borrow another fighter's shading and glow for every part. Try a Super Saiyan's on a base form!", {"Borrow another fighter's shading and glow for every part. Try a Super Saiyan's on a base form!", "Pegue sombra e brilho de outro lutador. Tente de um Super Saiyajin na forma base!", "Toma sombra y brillo de otro luchador. \302\241Prueba uno de Super Saiyan!"}},
