    {"Draw on your warrior's textures, or put a picture of your own on one! A mouse works too.", {"Draw on your warrior's textures, or put a picture of your own on one! A mouse works too.", "Desenhe nas texturas ou ponha uma imagem sua!", "\302\241Dibuja en las texturas o pon una imagen tuya!"}},
