    {"The little face on the grids: crop it from the render, or Circle for a photo!", {"The little face on the grids: crop it from the render, or Circle for a photo!", "O rostinho das grades: recorte do retrato ou fotografe!", "La carita de las rejillas: recorta o fotograf\303\255a."}},
    {"No guessing! Cross: the real character select. Circle: a test fight, health bar and all.", {"No guessing! Cross: the real character select. Circle: a test fight, health bar and all.", "Sem adivinhar! Veja na sele\303\247\303\243o real ou numa luta de teste.", "\302\241Sin adivinar! M\303\255ralo en la selecci\303\263n o en un combate de prueba."}},
