    {"Whose punches, kicks and rushes? The techniques below too, unless you swap them.", {"Whose punches, kicks and rushes? The techniques below too, unless you swap them.", "De quem s\303\243o socos, chutes e investidas? As t\303\251cnicas abaixo tamb\303\251m, se n\303\243o trocar.", "\302\277De qui\303\251n pu\303\261os, patadas y embestidas? Y las t\303\251cnicas si no las cambias."}},
    {"Whose ki blasts and charge? Each technique keeps its own effects.", {"Whose ki blasts and charge? Each technique keeps its own effects.", "De quem s\303\243o rajadas e carga? Cada t\303\251cnica mant\303\251m seus efeitos.", "\302\277De qui\303\251n r\303\241fagas y carga? Cada t\303\251cnica mantiene sus efectos."}},
    {"Add another fighter's part on top, like a second hairstyle or a scouter. Cross: choose the fighter. Left and right: choose the part.", {"Add another fighter's part on top, like a second hairstyle or a scouter. Cross: choose the fighter. Left and right: choose the part.", "Ponha a pe\303\247a de outro por cima, como um segundo cabelo ou um rastreador.", "Pon la pieza de otro encima, como otro peinado o un rastreador."}},
    {"Four outfits of your own! Turn it on, then pick a costume below and change its look.", {"Four outfits of your own! Turn it on, then pick a costume below and change its look.", "Quatro trajes seus! Ligue, escolha um traje e mude o visual.", "\302\241Cuatro trajes tuyos! Act\303\255valo, elige uno y cambia su aspecto."}},
    {"The costume you are changing now. Left and right for another; Square starts it again from Costume 1.", {"The costume you are changing now. Left and right for another; Square starts it again from Costume 1.", "O traje que est\303\241 mudando. Pode recome\303\247ar a partir do Traje 1.", "El traje que est\303\241s cambiando. Puedes recomenzarlo desde el 1."}},
